OL,3,GNEWSADemolition of 1970s shopping
OL,4,Acentre a step closer
OL,5,
OL,6,FContractors could be sought to demolish
OL,7,Fa 1970s shopping centre if the idea is
OL,8,Fapproved next week.
OL,10,FMilton Keynes City Council has
OL,11,Fearmarked the Brunel Centre site, plus
OL,12,Fthe former Wilko building, for
OL,13,Fredevelopment after being awarded
OL,14,F#22.7m as part of the government's Town
OL,15,FDeal Fund in 2021.
OL,17,FIf approved at a meeting on Tuesday
OL,18,Fevening, procurement could begin later
OL,19,Fin the month with demolition works
OL,20,Fexpected to start in phases later this
OL,21,Fyear.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
