OL,3,GNEWSADemolition of 1970s shopping
OL,4,Acentre a step closer
OL,5,
OL,6,FLabour's Ed Hume, Cabinet Member for
OL,7,FHousing, said: "This is a major
OL,8,Fmilestone in the transformation of
OL,9,FBletchley as the Town Deal programme is
OL,10,Fhelping us unlock significant
OL,11,Fopportunities across the town centre."
